h at realistic scale (scale=6371000) at origin. Place a Moon (scale=1737000) at distance 384000000 opposite a DirectionalLight3D such that the Earth eclipses the Moon. Move the camera around the system to observe the shadow disappearing and reappearing.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[shadow_bug_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29941912/shadow_bug_test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"SilverAlicorn","id":1009549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDk1NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1009549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn","html_url":"https://github.com/SilverAlicorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121290/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121290/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}